 function rulebook(){return `<details id="guns-rulebook" open><summary>Formation & strategy rules — reviewed against Adam’s course</summary><p>Charts are configured automatically: 1-minute execution / ATR, 5-minute premarket preparation, and daily context; EMA9, EMA20, SMA50 and SMA200. Indicators require real history and are not filled in when unavailable. Study colors differ from the course template.</p><p>Common preparation: corporate common stock (not ETF), price at least $1.50, gap at least 5%, observed premarket volume at least 30,000; manually verify favorable news (not fixed-price buyout) and daily room. Dated float evidence below the cap is required; missing float does not pass. The saved shortlist is attention guidance, not an approved setup.</p>${C.rules.map(r=>`<article><h3>S${r.id} · ${esc(C.names[r.id])}</h3><p><b>Formation:</b> ${esc(r.formation)}</p><p><b>Entry:</b> ${esc(r.entry)}</p><p><b>Stop-loss:</b> ${esc(r.stop)}</p><p><b>Target:</b> ${esc(r.target)}</p><p><b>Reject / manage:</b> ${esc(r.invalid)}</p><small>${esc(r.source)}</small></article>`).join('')}<p>Source: preserved GUNS_MASTER_DOCUMENT.md supplied by you. Review notes are summaries, not the original video or profit guarantees. Whole shares, fees, buying power and current marked equity govern size. Brackets are browser-local PAPER orders only; keep the app and Gateway running. Stops cannot guarantee loss limits.</p></details>`;}
